goal=r"""Wave 3 is the headline of the whole story: about 100 open-weight agents building one product on one laptop in a day. The about page (Epic 137) and the blog post (Epic 180) need numbers that prove it: epics and PRs per wave, PRs merged per hour, lines changed by lane, and a curve of how many agents were working in parallel over time. This epic extends Epic 68's collector to Wave 3 scale, **additively**, so the existing about page keeps rendering while the new one reads the richer data. Great looks like: one command regenerates `stats.json` (+ a Markdown digest for the blog and README), every number is reproducible from git/gh, and degraded sources are explained rather than hidden.""",
